{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794559107375,"sessionID":"ses_e2bf1936fffey5dOQ745xu1AFv","part":{"partID":"prt_1d40ede84001nll4Ol1ghXxN31","sessionID":"ses_e2bf1936fffey5dOQ745xu1AFv","messageID":"msg_1d40eb136001UqkFov3VVpomiD","type":"tool","id":"call_62d6492c79b94a7ea6bce0e6","tool":"grep","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"pattern":"hook-wiring check exits|hook-wiring check","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor"},"output":"Found 5 matches\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/README.markdown:\n  Line 112: | `hook-wiring-check.cjs` | The read-only hook-wiring check: it reads `.claude/settings.json`, `.codex/hooks.json`, `.cursor/hooks.json` and `.devin/hooks.v1.json`, and reports whether the prompt hook entry is present for each runtime folder it finds. `--root <dir>` is required and `--json` prints one object. It prints `ok <runtime>` or `hook-missing <runtime> <file>`, skips a runtime whose folder is absent and never writes. It exits 0 when every installed runtime is wired, 1 when one is missing and 2 on a bad argument or a missing root. |\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/doctor-setup-contract.test.cjs:\n  Line 56: test('the symlink output block maps the hook-wiring check exits to WARN and FAIL', () => {\n\n  Line 59:     /STATUS=WARN when the engine exits 0 and the hook-wiring check exits 1\\./,\n\n  Line 63:     /STATUS=FAIL when the hook-wiring check exits 2\\./,\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-symlink-check.yaml:\n  Line 28:   invariant: \"This route runs the check subcommand only. It never runs plan, apply or unlink, and it never writes a link, directory, ignore line or run record. Findings describe the target repository and do not change its state. The route also runs the read-only hook-wiring check, which reads each installed runtime's prompt hook entry and never writes.\"\n","title":"grep","metadata":{"metadata":{"matches":5,"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Found 5 matches\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/README.markdown:\n  Line 112: | `hook-wiring-check.cjs` | The read-only hook-wiring check: it reads `.claude/settings.json`, `.codex/hooks.json`, `.cursor/hooks.json` and `.devin/hooks.v1.json`, and reports whether the prompt hook entry is present for each runtime folder it finds. `--root <dir>` is required and `--json` prints one object. It prints `ok <runtime>` or `hook-missing <runtime> <file>`, skips a runtime whose folder is absent and never writes. It exits 0 when every installed runtime is wired, 1 when one is missing and 2 on a bad argument or a missing root. |\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/doctor-setup-contract.test.cjs:\n  Line 56: test('the symlink output block maps the hook-wiring check exits to WARN and FAIL', () => {\n\n  Line 59:     /STATUS=WARN when the engine exits 0 and the hook-wiring check exits 1\\./,\n\n  Line 63:     /STATUS=FAIL when the hook-wiring check exits 2\\./,\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-symlink-check.yaml:\n  Line 28:   invariant: \"This route runs the check subcommand only. It never runs plan, apply or unlink, and it never writes a link, directory, ignore line or run record. Findings describe the target repository and do not change its state. The route also runs the read-only hook-wiring check, which reads each installed runtime's prompt hook entry and never writes.\"\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"pattern\":\"hook-wiring check exits|hook-wiring check\",\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/commands/doctor\"}"},"time":{"start":1794559106692,"end":1794559107375}}}}
